Well, if you have been holding on to your papers&nbsp;
so far, now, squeeze that paper because these&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:21.200
somewhat reduced examples work in real time. This&nbsp;
means that we can point a camera at ourselves,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:27.200
do our thing, and see ourselves become&nbsp;
these people on our screens in real time.

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:32.240
Now, I love the film directing&nbsp;
aspect of these videos, and also,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:39.600
I am super excited for us to be able to even&nbsp;
